This package composes the MIT-licensed @felan-ai/agent-core and Felan extension
packages listed in package.json. Their package-level LICENSE and NOTICE files
contain the applicable attribution and source provenance.

The optional Codebase Memory integration uses @felan-ai/ext-codebase-memory,
which adapts pi-cbm 1.2.1 and integrates with codebase-memory-mcp 0.11.0. The
native executable is installed only after explicit confirmation and is not
bundled in this npm package. Its package-level LICENSE and NOTICE contain the
immutable source revisions and terms.

The local-first memory integration is original MIT-licensed Felan code from
@felan-ai/ext-memory. Its package-level LICENSE and NOTICE contain the
applicable attribution.

The session compaction integration uses original Felan code from
@felan-ai/ext-session-compaction. Its design references reviewed releases of
pi-smart-compact and pi-vcc; no upstream source is bundled. Its package-level
LICENSE and NOTICE contain the applicable attribution.

The classifier integration uses original Felan Pi-backed bridge code from
@felan-ai/agent-core. The host may inject it into local runtimes.
The model tools integration uses original MIT-licensed Felan code from
@felan-ai/ext-model-tools. Its package-level LICENSE and NOTICE contain the
applicable attribution.

The Fusion integration uses original MIT-licensed Felan code from
@felan-ai/ext-fusion. It is design-informed by disler/fusion-harness at the
reviewed revision recorded in the extension's NOTICE; no upstream source or
prompt text is copied. Its package-level LICENSE and NOTICE contain details.

The Claude Code integration uses @felan-ai/ext-claude-code, adapted from
pi-claude-bridge 0.9.3 by Eli Dickinson, originally based on Prateek Sunal's
claude-agent-sdk-pi. Its package-level LICENSE and NOTICE record the MIT
attribution and source revision. The proprietary Claude Agent SDK and its
MCP peers are installed only after explicit approval under Anthropic's terms;
the Claude Agent SDK and Claude Code executable are not bundled.

